        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1244_4157.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gannz</unclear> genaigt, willig, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geülissen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">freiündtlich</unclear>
<lb n="2"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diinnst</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">grueß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuevor</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ervesste</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Vorsüichtige</unclear>,
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ersame</unclear> unnd weise, besünders liebe Herren unnd
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Freiündt</unclear>.
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Wiir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wellen</unclear> eüch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">freiündtlicher</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wolmainüng</unclear> nach,
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schriftlichen</unclear> nit pergen, das <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wiir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diser</unclear> tagen, den
<lb n="7"/>Erparn <persName resp="#ner">Erasmüs Haltmaiyern</persName>, ainen ledebe-
<lb n="8"/>reüttern, von eüwerer Statt zu <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">St: Gallen</placeName> In
<lb n="9"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-287" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Schweiz</unclear></placeName>, gepürttig (<unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wellicher</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vner</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seinnheine</unclear>
<lb n="10"/>des <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Allmechtigen</unclear> mit unnserer gewesnen mitbür-
<lb n="11"/>gerß, weilündt <persName resp="#ner">Hanns Heppachers</persName> seeligen nach-
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gelasnen</unclear> tochter mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">namen</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Margreta</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ec</unclear>,
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Christenlicher</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ordnüng</unclear> nach Ehlichen verheüratet,
<lb n="14"/>derowegen sich Inn <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unser</unclear> Statt <placeName resp="#ner">Nühaerten</placeName> bürg-
<lb n="15"/>er: unnd Heüßlichen Nüiderzelasßen gewilldt) vf
<lb n="16"/>seini beschehne Eenstlich unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vleisigs</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anhaltten</unclear>
<lb n="17"/>unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Pitten</unclear>, Inn <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vnnser</unclear> Statt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bürgerrecht</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zü</unclear>
<lb n="18"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ainem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Bürgern</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Innwohnern</unclear> gemelter
<lb n="19"/>Statt <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Nühaerten</unclear></placeName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gindiglich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vft</unclear> unnd angenomen,
<lb n="20"/>dergestalt unnd also, das Er sich Inn allweg
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wie</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ainem</unclear> gehorsamen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bürgern</unclear> gepürtt, Inn
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alllen</unclear> Inn vferlegten bürgerlichen beschweer-
<lb n="23"/>den, gehorsamb, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wendenlich</unclear>, unnd wol erzaigen,
<lb n="24"/>unnd verhalten, so dann sein Ehrlich Mann:
<lb n="25"/>Auch das gepürendt bürgerrecht, wie gepreüchig,
<lb n="26"/>uflegen unnd erstatten solle <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ec</unclear>. Welches Er also
<lb n="27"/>zuthün zügesagt, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darneben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vner</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sprochen</unclear>,
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sini</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ehrlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Mannrecht</unclear> unnd vvrkhündt Ehelicher
<lb n="29"/>gepürdt, aüch sein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bis</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hero</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verlügt</unclear> Patrimonium
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1244_4158.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gebuerendt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vätter</unclear>: unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">muetterlich</unclear> erbguot, inn er-
<lb n="31"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">meltem</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deinem</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">heimbweeßen</unclear>, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vatterlandt</unclear>
<lb n="32"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sant</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gallen</unclear></placeName>, erheben unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abhollen</unclear> wolle,
<lb n="33"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darumb</unclear> unns gebetten, ime <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ain</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gloubwuerdig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schrei</unclear>-
<lb n="34"/>ben an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">euch</unclear> (damit ime <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hierinn</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">desto</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mehrer</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">glou</unclear>-
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bens</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuogestelt</unclear> unnd gegeben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wuerde</unclear>) <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zueerthailen</unclear>,
<lb n="36"/>welches <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wier</unclear> ime umb sollicher <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">pillicher</unclear>, unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gehoe</unclear>-
<lb n="37"/>ter <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">denckwuerdiger</unclear> ursachen willen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zueverwaigern</unclear>
<lb n="38"/>nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gewueßt</unclear>, sunder <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gantz</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guetwillig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mitthail</unclear>-
<lb n="39"/>len, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">neben</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dem</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">auch</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">euch</unclear>, wie die sachen jetziger
<lb n="40"/>zeit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gelegenhait</unclear> nach, mit ime <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Haltmaijern</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beschaffen</unclear>,
<lb n="41"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unngeveltet</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vorgelauettermaßen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">frueindtlich</unclear> be-
<lb n="42"/>richten wollen.
<lb n="43"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Mitt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angeheffter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frueindtlicher</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vleißiger</unclear>
<lb n="44"/>pitt, ir wöllen gedachtem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eraßmo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Haltmaijern</unclear>,
<lb n="45"/>gleich unns selbsten, inn sollichem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seinem</unclear> pillichen
<lb n="46"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werben</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ansuchen</unclear> glouben geben, ime nit
<lb n="47"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allain</unclear> sein <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bißhero</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beij</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">euch</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verpflegt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vätter</unclear>:
<lb n="48"/>unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">muetterlich</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erbguett</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gegen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erstattung</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ge</unclear>-
<lb n="49"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">puerender</unclear> quittung, sunder <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">auch</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">urkhundtlichen</unclear>
<lb n="50"/>briefflichen schein, seiner <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehrlichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gebuertt</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auch</unclear>
<lb n="51"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verhaltens</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thuen</unclear>, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">laßens</unclear>, inn <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gepuerender</unclear>
<lb n="52"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fomm</unclear> geben, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mitthaillen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuekumen</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wueder</unclear>-
<lb n="53"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fahren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">laßen</unclear>, unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sunsten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">euch</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hierinen</unclear>
<lb n="54"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gegen</unclear> ime <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">also</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guenstig</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">willfärrig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erweißen</unclear>,
<lb n="55"/>wie <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">euch</unclear> unnser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ungezweiffelte</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zueversicht</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">stehet</unclear>,
<lb n="56"/>unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wier</unclear> unns die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gedancken</unclear> machen, ir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werden</unclear>
<lb n="57"/>das <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuethuen</unclear> vorhin <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fuer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">euch</unclear> selbsten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guenstig</unclear>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1244_4159.jpg" n="3"/>
<lb n="58"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">geneigt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">seini</unclear>, das <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">befindt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unns</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">umb</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hin</unclear>-
<lb n="59"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">widerumben</unclear>, inn dergleichen, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mehrenem</unclear>
<lb n="60"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuotragenden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fählen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gepür</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nach</unclear>, gantz <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ge</unclear>-
<lb n="61"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">flissen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">geneigt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">willig</unclear>, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründtlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuoverdie</unclear>-
<lb n="62"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nen</unclear>, datum <origPlace resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Stutgarten</unclear></origPlace> den <origDate when="1601" cert="medium" resp="#ner">24. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">tgst</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Martij</unclear>
<lb n="63"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">veteris</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">styli</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Anno</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">1</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">5</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">89</unclear></origDate>.
<lb n="64"/>Vogt, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Burgermeister</unclear>
<lb n="65"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Gericht</unclear> zu <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Stut</unclear>-
<lb n="66"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">garten</unclear>,
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1244_4160.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="67"/>Den ehrenvoesten vorsuechtigen, ersamen
<lb n="68"/>und weisen, herrn <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">burgermaistern und
<lb n="69"/>rath der statt zu Sanct Gallen</orgName>, unn-
<lb n="70"/>sern besunders lieben herrn unnd freun-
<lb n="71"/>den.
</p>
